 "validity": "<b>Validity of Quotation:</b> This quotation is valid for 24 hours from the date of issue and is subject to hotel and room availability as no space has been secured. A deposit of RM 250 per person is required upon confirmation, with full payment due 45 days prior to departure. A late booking surcharge of RM 50 per booking applies to bookings made less than 45 days before the departure date. Prices are quoted for 2 to 3 persons per room; at the 3-Star Hotel a triple room uses an extra bed, while a proper triple bed is available only at the 4-Star Hotel. Single supplement is RM 550 per person. Private transportation is unlimited until midnight. Peak season surcharge applies as stated and is not included in the base price. Suggested arrival and departure times are at noon; late arrivals or early departures will not be refunded for activities and meals missed. Itinerary, price and flight schedule are subject to change. Final itinerary and hotel arrangements will be confirmed 14 days before the trip. This package is valid for travel until 31 March 2027. Ground arrangement and tipping only - flight tickets are not included.",
